<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFA seeks 105,000 tonnes of feed wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFA seeks 105,000 tonnes of feed wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Korea Feed Association (KFA) has invited tenders for 105,000 tonnes of feed wheat, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>    POSITION TONNE    SHIPMENT	 ARRIVAL/PORT</p>
<p>  ONE    52,500   Jan 1-20	 Feb 5/Inchon, Pusan or Ulsan</p>
<p>  TWO    52,500   Jan 25-Feb 13  Feb 25/Pusan, Ulsan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
